# Build artifacts
/target/

# Node dependencies and generated static output.
#
# Neither is copied from the context by any Dockerfile stage. The static stage
# runs `bun install --frozen-lockfile` and `bun run build` itself, so it creates
# both inside the image, pinned to bun.lock rather than to whatever happens to
# be on the machine doing the build; the runtime stage takes dist via
# `COPY --from=static`. Sending them anyway meant uploading files the build
# never reads: measured 136.90 MB of context without these two lines, 103.74 kB
# with them.
node_modules/
/dist/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

